                                "sense_id": "46d9010f-ef6c-39a1-8f41-8d149e00f1b7",
                                "text": "1819, Timothy Dwight, Theology: Explained and Defended in a Series of Sermons, Volume 5, page 143,\nAccordingly, Dr. Young says forcibly, and justly, though solecistically,\n\" A shameless woman is the worst of men.\""
